"ai_prompt_hint" = "Copy the prompt below to any AI assistant (Doubao, ChatGPT…), send your timetable screenshot, then paste the AI output back into the text field above to import.";
"ai_prompt_text" = "Please convert the timetable screenshot I send next into plain text with these rules:\\n1. One line per class session, 7 columns separated by tabs: course name, teacher, room, weekday, period, weeks, type\\n2. Weekday as a number: 1=Monday … 7=Sunday\\n3. Period as a range like 1-2; a single period is just the number, e.g. 3\\n4. Weeks as a range like 1-16; partial-semester courses use the actual range, e.g. 1-8\\n5. Type: 0=every week, 1=odd weeks, 2=even weeks\\n6. If teacher or room is not shown in the screenshot, use - as placeholder; never invent values\\n7. Split a course held at multiple times into multiple lines; no spaces inside course names\\n8. The first line must be exactly <<<SLEEPY-BEGIN>>> and the last line exactly <<<SLEEPY-END>>>, with the course lines in between; nothing else outside those two lines — no explanations, no examples, no code fences\\n\\n9. If the screenshot shows per-period times at the top (e.g. \"Period 1 08:00-09:35\"), output those time lines verbatim before the course lines, format: PeriodN HH:mm HH:mmSample output (format reference only, do not copy the content):\\n<<<SLEEPY-BEGIN>>>\\nCalculus\\tJohn\\tA101\\t1\\t1-2\\t1-16\\t0\\nEnglish\\tMary\\tB202\\t3\\t3-4\\t1-16\\t1\\n<<<SLEEPY-END>>>";
